        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An action-platformer like no other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball is <strong>physics-based</strong>, and your character has <strong>tight controls</strong>. The clash between the unpredictability of the ball and the precision of the player, is what makes every play session <strong>unique</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goals vary between taking the ball to a goal, <strong>smashing enemies</strong> with it, breaking blocks, and <strong>much more! </strong>Can you <strong>master</strong> this challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/2450763a00baa19e420930672692999b.poster.avif?t=1762947550\" width=760 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/2450763a00baa19e420930672692999b.webm?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/2450763a00baa19e420930672692999b.mp4?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick levels</strong> that allow you to better manage your play time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to</strong> <strong>master</strong> gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, optional <strong>character dialogue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up system that <strong>unlocks</strong> new challenges and worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highscores keep the <strong>replayability</strong> high</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/b300a2e7963f1a579d721d8aee5aa102.poster.avif?t=1762947550\" width=760 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/b300a2e7963f1a579d721d8aee5aa102.webm?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/b300a2e7963f1a579d721d8aee5aa102.mp4?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Varied game modes for a diversified experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whack'a'Mole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the blocks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/e910b74605a83df4fc2b0cfd96b3738a.poster.avif?t=1762947550\" width=760 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/e910b74605a83df4fc2b0cfd96b3738a.webm?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/e910b74605a83df4fc2b0cfd96b3738a.mp4?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help Sona achieve her dream of becoming a pro Cyber Volley athlete!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This young girl wants to become a star of the most popular sport in the near future: Cyber Volley! Its up to you to win each challenge to make her shine!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An action-platformer like no other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball is <strong>physics-based</strong>, and your character has <strong>tight controls</strong>. The clash between the unpredictability of the ball and the precision of the player, is what makes every play session <strong>unique</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goals vary between taking the ball to a goal, <strong>smashing enemies</strong> with it, breaking blocks, and <strong>much more! </strong>Can you <strong>master</strong> this challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/2450763a00baa19e420930672692999b.poster.avif?t=1762947550\" width=760 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/2450763a00baa19e420930672692999b.webm?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/2450763a00baa19e420930672692999b.mp4?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick levels</strong> that allow you to better manage your play time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to</strong> <strong>master</strong> gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, optional <strong>character dialogue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up system that <strong>unlocks</strong> new challenges and worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highscores keep the <strong>replayability</strong> high</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/b300a2e7963f1a579d721d8aee5aa102.poster.avif?t=1762947550\" width=760 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/b300a2e7963f1a579d721d8aee5aa102.webm?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/b300a2e7963f1a579d721d8aee5aa102.mp4?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Varied game modes for a diversified experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whack'a'Mole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the blocks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/e910b74605a83df4fc2b0cfd96b3738a.poster.avif?t=1762947550\" width=760 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/e910b74605a83df4fc2b0cfd96b3738a.webm?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881670/extras/e910b74605a83df4fc2b0cfd96b3738a.mp4?t=1762947550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help Sona achieve her dream of becoming a pro Cyber Volley athlete!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This young girl wants to become a star of the most popular sport in the near future: Cyber Volley! Its up to you to win each challenge to make her shine!</p>",
